  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Rib cap steak shines as the centerpiece of any backyard feast, its rich marbling sizzling the moment it meets high heat. A deep golden crust forms quickly, sealing in buttery tenderness while garlic, citrus, and a splash of apple cider vinegar create an aromatic marinade that lifts every flavor. As savory smoke fills the kitchen, you baste the steak with creamy herb butter, drawing out even more juiciness. Each slice is fork tender and full of indulgent character, perfect for gatherings of any size. Pair your rib cap steak with roasted potatoes and tender greens for a meal everyone will remember.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-rib-cap-steak\">Why You’ll Love This rib cap steak</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-rib-cap-steak\">How to Make rib cap steak</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-rib-cap-steak\">Pro Tips for Making rib cap steak</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-rib-cap-steak\">How to Serve this rib cap steak</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-rib-cap-steak\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This rib cap steak</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Incredibly tender and juicy, making every bite a delight.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Rich, beefy flavor that elevates any meal to gourmet status.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for grilling or pan-searing, offering versatility in cooking.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Impressive presentation that will wow your guests.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick to prepare, so you can enjoy a restaurant-quality dish at home.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-cont